          "why_it_matters": "This is more specific than a routine Grateful Dead recreation. Reckoning stripped the Dead down to acoustic space, songcraft, bluegrass roots, and unusually delicate ensemble listening; building a full Anthem night around that record gives Dark Star Orchestra a tighter musical problem than simply choosing another historical setlist. The Rex Foundation benefit adds a direct line back to the Dead's community tradition without changing the fact that the music itself is the reason to care.",
